F1 scores in traverse dataset (Cliff Walking) or expert dataset (all other domains) for <span id="A3.T12.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFB3B3;">Llama 3.1 8B</span>, <span id="A3.T12.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#B3B3FF;">Llama 3.1 70B</span>, <span id="A3.T12.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#B3FFB3;">QwQ 32B</span>, and <span id="A3.T12.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFB3;">R1</span>.
