<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">You are playing MineCraft and you want to craft diamond. You will be asked to compare two actions given a state and provide preference.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are in forest.
