</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You have the following items in your inventory:</span></span>
