<span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">stick: 8</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p5.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You can take these actions:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
